cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Featurizer: automated feature engineering for temporal data using PostgreSQL"
abstract: >-
  Featurizer implements Deep Feature Synthesis (Kanter & Veeramachaneni, IEEE
  DSAA 2015) for relational PostgreSQL data with first-class temporal
  semantics. An entity graph is declared once in YAML; Featurizer traverses
  the relationships, applies aggregations and transformations across them, and
  emits pure SQL that computes a point-in-time-correct feature matrix indexed
  by (as_of_date, entity_id). Features are computed where the data lives, so
  no data leaves the database.
type: software
